</div></li>
<li id="S0.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><math id="S0.I1.i2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\blacktriangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#2D4CB9;" mathcolor="#2D4CB9">▶</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\blacktriangleright</annotation></semantics></math></span> 
