</div></li>
</ul>
    
<p id="abstract1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="abstract1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Region-Specialized Models</span></p>
    
<ul id="S0.I2" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="S0.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><math id="S0.I2.i1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\blacktriangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#2D4CB9;" mathcolor="#2D4CB9">▶</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\blacktriangleright</annotation></semantics></math></span> 
<div id="S0.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S0.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><a href="https://hf.co/CohereLabs/tiny-aya-earth" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href ltx_font_bold"><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Tiny Aya</span> Earth</a>: Strongest for languages across Africa and West Asia regions</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S0.I2.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><math id="S0.I2.i2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\blacktriangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#2D4CB9;" mathcolor="#2D4CB9">▶</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\blacktriangleright</annotation></semantics></math></span> 
