<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A6.T25.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 25</span>: </span><span id="A6.T25.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Open-ended generation quality on mDolly.<span id="A6.T25.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> We report the aggregated score by the LLM judge (averaged across four rubrics, see <a href="#S4.SS3" title="4.3 Open-ended LLM Judge Evaluations ‣ 4 Evaluating multilingual capability at scale ‣ Tiny Aya:" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Section</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.3</span></a>), the judge’s score assigned to the naturalness rubric, and language id line pass rate from FastText.</span></span></figcaption>
