</section>
<section id="A7" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix G </span>Safety</h2>

<div id="A7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><a href="#A7.T26" title="In Appendix G Safety ‣ Tiny Aya:" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">26</span></a> reports detailed by-language scores for MultiJail <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib23" title="" class="ltx_ref">Deng et al., 2024</a>)</cite>. We use <span id="A7.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Command A</span> as a judge in contextual safety mode.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A7.T26" class="ltx_table">
<div id="A7.T26.3" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:345.0pt;height:60.9pt;vertical-align:-29.5pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-273.6pt,48.3pt) scale(0.386710374728639,0.386710374728639) ;">
<table id="A7.T26.3.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
